WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:04.197
Sunshine Coffee Shop was packed.

2
00:00:04.198 --> 00:00:08.065
People sat at tables, drinking coffee and eating baked goods.

3
00:00:08.066 --> 00:00:10.007
A woman stood behind the counter.

4
00:00:10.008 --> 00:00:12.714
"I can help the next customer."

5
00:00:12.715 --> 00:00:15.022
A man stepped up to the counter.

6
00:00:15.023 --> 00:00:17.345
He ordered a cup of tea.

7
00:00:17.346 --> 00:00:21.898
"I'll also have a donut, please."

8
00:00:21.899 --> 00:00:27.054
He sat down and took a bite of his donut. Suddenly . . .

9
00:00:27.055 --> 00:00:31.937
"Grargh!"

10
00:00:31.938 --> 00:00:36.330
"Yuck!" Jack looked at the food on his tray and frowned.

11
00:00:36.331 --> 00:00:40.475
"Why did Principal Penn have to change the menu?"

12
00:00:40.476 --> 00:00:42.017
It was lunchtime.

13
00:00:42.018 --> 00:00:44.982
Roxy and her friends were in the school cafeteria.

14
00:00:44.983 --> 00:00:48.093
Today was the first day with the new lunch menu.

15
00:00:48.094 --> 00:00:51.641
The kids' trays were full of vegetables and whole grains.

16
00:00:51.642 --> 00:00:55.002
All of the food was now healthy and organic.

17
00:00:55.003 --> 00:00:57.907
Terrell groaned.

18
00:00:57.908 --> 00:01:00.815
"Why did Principal Penn do this to us?

19
00:01:00.816 --> 00:01:05.551
The old menu was perfect, except for sloppy joes."

20
00:01:05.552 --> 00:01:08.633
"You two are acting silly," Mara said.

21
00:01:08.634 --> 00:01:11.306
"This food is delicious."

22
00:01:11.307 --> 00:01:14.406
She took a bite of her kale salad and smiled.

23
00:01:14.407 --> 00:01:17.216
She ate some more.

24
00:01:17.217 --> 00:01:19.918
Terrell looked at his food suspiciously.

25
00:01:19.919 --> 00:01:23.217
He stuck his fork into a small cube and held it up.

26
00:01:23.218 --> 00:01:25.724
"What is this thing?"

27
00:01:25.725 --> 00:01:28.462
"It's tofu," Mara said.

28
00:01:28.463 --> 00:01:30.628
"It's made from soybeans.

29
00:01:30.629 --> 00:01:33.466
It's good. You should try it."

30
00:01:33.467 --> 00:01:38.604
Terrell wrinkled his nose. "No, thanks!"

31
00:01:38.605 --> 00:01:40.967
The tofu fell off his fork.

32
00:01:40.968 --> 00:01:44.501
It bounced off the table and landed on the floor.

33
00:01:44.502 --> 00:01:47.416
A kid walking by stepped on the tofu.

34
00:01:47.417 --> 00:01:51.154
It was now flat and mushy, with bits of dirt on it.

35
00:01:51.155 --> 00:01:55.127
Jack and Terrell laughed.

36
00:01:55.128 --> 00:01:57.683
"I like the new menu," Roxy said.

37
00:01:57.684 --> 00:02:01.851
"Also, this isn't the only thing Principal Penn changed.

38
00:02:01.852 --> 00:02:04.341
She wants everyone to be healthier.

39
00:02:04.342 --> 00:02:07.722
So she added ten more minutes to recess."

40
00:02:07.723 --> 00:02:11.414
"Now that is a good change!" Jack said.

41
00:02:11.415 --> 00:02:14.705
"Yeah, but . . ." Terrell sighed.

42
00:02:14.706 --> 00:02:19.095
"I wish Rocket Girl would save us from this kale and tofu."

43
00:02:19.096 --> 00:02:21.000
Roxy rolled her eyes.

44
00:02:21.001 --> 00:02:24.848
"Rocket Girl has more important things to do, Terrell.

45
00:02:24.849 --> 00:02:29.291
And besides, maybe Rocket Girl actually likes this kind of food."

46
00:02:29.292 --> 00:02:31.497
Terrell gave Roxy a sly look.

47
00:02:31.498 --> 00:02:34.525
"She does? How do you know?"

48
00:02:34.526 --> 00:02:37.958
Roxy froze. "Um . . ."

49
00:02:37.959 --> 00:02:41.337
Just then her watch beeped.

50
00:02:41.338 --> 00:02:45.956
"I'll be right back," Roxy told her friends.

51
00:02:45.957 --> 00:02:50.578
She went into the hallway and flipped the watch open.

52
00:02:50.579 --> 00:02:52.674
Mayor Bloom looked scared.

53
00:02:52.675 --> 00:02:55.672
"What's wrong, Mayor?" Roxy asked.

54
00:02:55.673 --> 00:02:59.765
"Rocket Girl! Something terrible is happening," Mayor Bloom said.

55
00:02:59.766 --> 00:03:02.662
"Hungry zombies are invading Metro City!

56
00:03:02.663 --> 00:03:05.656
There's a crowd of them at Sunshine Coffee Shop!"

57
00:03:05.657 --> 00:03:12.482
Roxy gulped. "Don't worry, Mayor. I'm on my way!"

